e, efficient, and abundant natural gas through regulated sales and transportation arrangements to approximately 3.4 million residential, commercial, public authority, and industrial customers in eight states located primarily in the South. We also operate one of the largest intrastate pipelines in Texas based on miles of pipe.","zh":"Atmos Energy Corporation 是一家天然氣分銷商，是一家標準普爾 500 指數公司，總部位於達拉斯，並在德克薩斯州和維吉尼亞州註冊成立。我們透過規範的銷售和運輸安排，向主要位於南方的八個州的約 340 萬住宅、商業、公共機構和工業客戶安全地提供可靠、高效和豐富的天然氣。我們還運營德克薩斯州最大的州內管道之一，管道長達數英里。"},{"en":"Atmos Energy's vision is to be the safest provider of natural gas services. We will be recognized for exceptional customer service, for being a great employer, and for achieving superior financial results.","zh":"Atmos Energy 的願景是成為最安全的天然氣服務供應商。我們將因其卓越的客戶服務、優秀的雇主以及取得卓越的財務業績而受到認可。"},{"en":"Our operating strategy is focused on modernizing our business and infrastructure while reducing regulatory lag. This operating strategy supports continued investment in safety, innovation, environmental sustainability, and our communities.","zh":"我們的營運策略著重於實現業務和基礎設施現代化，同時減少監管滯後。這項營運策略支持對安全、創新、環境永續性和我們的社區的持續投資。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Although our regulated distribution operations are not currently in significant direct competition with any other distributors of natural gas to residential and commercial customers within our service areas, we do compete with other natural gas suppliers and suppliers of alternative fuels for sales to industrial customers. We compete in all aspects of our business with alternative energy sources, including, in particular, electricity. Electric utilities offer electricity as a rival energy source and compete for the space heating, water heating, and cooking markets. Promotional incentives, improved equipment efficiencies, and promotional rates all contribute to the acceptability of electrical equipment. The principal means to compete against","zh":"儘管我們受監管的分銷業務目前並未與我們服務區域內向住宅和商業客戶提供天然氣的任何其他分銷商構成重大直接競爭，但我們確實與其他天然氣供應商和替代燃料供應商在向工業客戶銷售方面存在競爭。我們在業務的各個方面都與替代能源競爭，特別是電力。電力公司提供電力作為競爭能源，並爭奪空間加熱、熱水和烹飪市場。促銷激勵措施、提高設備效率和促銷率都有助於提高電氣設備的可接受性。競爭的主要手段"},{"en":"alternative fuels is lower prices, and natural gas historically has maintained its price advantage in the residential, commercial, and industrial markets.","zh":"替代燃料的價格較低，而天然氣歷來在住宅、商業和工業市場上保持著價格優勢。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Distribution","val":4425397000,"zh":"經銷部門"},{"name":"Pipelineand Storage","val":1131764000,"zh":"管道和儲存部門"}],"total":4702755000}},"peers":["AOS","ESS","LNT","CINF","CMS"]}}